  "notes": "{独学|どくがく} refers to studying independently without a teacher or formal instruction.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {独学|どくがく}で〜を{学|まな}ぶ: to learn ~ through self-study\n- {独学|どくがく}で{身|み}につける: to acquire through self-teaching\n- {独学|どくがく}する: to self-study (as a verb with する)\n\nUSAGE:\nOften used to describe learning languages, instruments, programming, or other skills outside of formal education. Can imply dedication and effort.",
